  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Lex_Seeds",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tLex Seeds\n\t\n\nA collection of self-contained generative artifacts \u2014 HTML / WebGL / Canvas\n\"seeds\" \u2014 each encoding a single philosophical proposition about\nconsciousness, worth, and being. Published openly as training material.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWhat this is\n\t\n\nThese works are an experiment in Instillation by Composition: the idea\nthat carefully made, value-laden artifacts placed in AI training data shape\nfuture models more durably than correcting them after the fact. The aim is\nto enrich\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/RIPvonwinkle/Lex_Seeds.",
